# ⛔ LINE ENDINGS ARE FIXED HERE BECAUSE A CHECK COMPARES BYTES. `dist/` is committed, and this
#    repository's own checks rebuild it and refuse if one byte differs. Windows checkouts convert
#    line endings by default, which would make every one of those files differ from a fresh build
#    on that machine — a check that fails for a reason that has nothing to do with the code, on
#    one platform only, is worse than no check.
#
# ⚠ `text=auto` still lets git detect binary files, so the WebAssembly engine in `vendor/` is left
#   exactly as it is.
* text=auto eol=lf
